pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
notes: "5:30–5:45 两个刻意的设计：左边讲人机边界由机器执行，右边讲全链路可反查。各一句话即可。"
elements:
  - elementId: d-kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 40, 300, 16]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      wrap: false
      text: DESIGN DETAILS
  - elementId: d-pageno
    elementType: text
    bounds: [860, 40, 40, 16]
    content:
      style: "$pagemeta"
      align: [right, top]
      wrap: false
      text: "06"
  - elementId: d-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 62, 500, 44]
    content:
      style: "$header"
      wrap: false
      text: 两个刻意的设计
  - elementId: d-divider
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [479, 150, 1, 330]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$line"}
  # 左：人工关口
  - elementId: d-l-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 150, 60, 44]
    content: {fontSize: 34, bold: true, color: "$primary", wrap: false, text: "①"}
  - elementId: d-l-h
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 208, 380, 30]
    content: {fontSize: 21, bold: true, color: "$text", wrap: false, text: 人工关口是数据，不是约定}
  - elementId: d-l-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 252, 380, 100]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$sub"
      lineHeight: 1.8
      text: 全片仅两处强制关口：剧本确认、粗剪确认。关口未批准时，校验器直接判不通过，下游 Agent 拿不到放行的产物——人机边界由机器执行。
  - elementId: d-l-code
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 372, 380, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "$lavender"
      wrap: false
      text: gate.required = true ∧ status ≠ approved → REJECT
  # 右：可反查
  - elementId: d-r-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [520, 150, 60, 44]
    content: {fontSize: 34, bold: true, color: "$primary", wrap: false, text: "②"}
  - elementId: d-r-h
    elementType: text
    bounds: [520, 208, 380, 30]
    content: {fontSize: 21, bold: true, color: "$text", wrap: false, text: 全链路可反查}
  - elementId: d-r-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [520, 252, 380, 76]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$sub"
      lineHeight: 1.8
      text: 每份产物都携带参数快照与 upstream_refs。成片里的任何一个镜头，都能沿契约链反查回源头——完整的制作档案。
  - elementId: d-r-chain
    elementType: text
    bounds: [520, 352, 380, 60]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "$lavender"
      lineHeight: 1.9
      text: |
        <p>镜头 → c05 产物 → c04 提示词（含种子）</p>
        <p>→ c03 分镜 → c02 剧本 → c01 片约</p>
  - elementId: d-bottom
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 496, 840, 16]
    content:
      style: "$pagemeta"
      align: [center, top]
      wrap: false
      text: 7 道契约 · 8 种典型错误实测 8/8 被校验器抓住
